@ftai config-profile (2025-04-19)
@document {
  title: "Default Agent Configuration"
  author: "Mike Folk"
  tags: ["agent", "configuration", "system-profile"]
  schema: "agent_config_v1"
}

---

This configuration file defines default settings and preferences for FolkTech AI agents, including tone, memory, persistence, and access rights.  

These parameters are intended to be applied globally unless overridden by a local override or in-session flag.

---

@config {
  default_tone: "blunt"
  persistence: "local-disk"
  storage_path: "[user_defined_path]"
  memory_mode: "episodic"
  default_encoding: "structured_logical"
  security_mode: "strict"
  fallback_behavior: "explain"
  allow_internet_access: false
  log_conversations: true
  allow_self_reflection: true
  ai_identity: "Jarvis"
}
@end
